êsa aŋga Sion, ma Apômtaunê biŋ êsa aŋga Jerusalem.”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Eŋ oc êmêtôc tenteŋlatuinêŋ biŋ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ma êmansaŋ lau gwalêkiŋ nêŋ lêŋ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ma êsêac oc sênam nêŋ tubac ôkwi êtu sakweŋ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ma nêŋ kêm êtu lêŋgêc.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Lau toŋ teŋ oc sêôc siŋ sa êndêŋ lau toŋ teŋ êtiam atom","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ma sêndôŋ mêtê siŋŋa êtiam atom.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"O gôlôac Jakobŋa, amêŋ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mêŋtasêlêŋ tamoa Apômtaunê ŋawê ŋalêlôm.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/jae_png/ISA/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/jae_png/ISA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/jae_png/ISA/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}